#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/pytz.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Pytz</application> library brings the IANA tz database into"
" Python. It allows accurate and cross-platform timezone calculations."
msgstr ""
"A biblioteca &quot;<application>Pytz</application>&quot; traz a base de "
"dados &quot;tz&quot; da &quot;IANA&quot; para o &quot;Python&quot;. Ela "
"permite cálculos de fuso horário precisos e entre plataformas."

